WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:02.326
- Okay girls, I'm gonna
say whatever I think.

00:00:02.326 --> 00:00:05.493
(inspirational music)

00:00:07.182 --> 00:00:09.394
- To all the girls out
there who actually like

00:00:09.394 --> 00:00:11.951
wanted to be perfect,
perfect doesn't exist.

00:00:11.951 --> 00:00:14.895
- You don't have to become
Britney Spears or Beyonce

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:16.079
in order to be happy.

00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:18.439
- Confidence is not something
that happens overnight.

00:00:18.439 --> 00:00:19.585
Don't rush yourself.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.493
- Every room you enter, you belong in.

00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:24.646
You're not supposed to not be somewhere.

00:00:24.646 --> 00:00:26.647
You're not the person who doesn't belong.

00:00:26.647 --> 00:00:27.705
You're not the person
who should be sitting

00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:29.163
in the back of the room.

00:00:29.163 --> 00:00:31.237
If you're in that room, you're
supposed to be in that room.

00:00:31.237 --> 00:00:33.337
You're probably the smartest
person in that room,

00:00:33.337 --> 00:00:34.354
and act like it.

00:00:34.354 --> 00:00:36.484
- As long as you're doing one thing,

00:00:36.484 --> 00:00:39.290
one thing a day to make
yourself feel empowered

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.211
or feel loved, or just look
at yourself in the mirror,

00:00:41.211 --> 00:00:42.899
and go, "Dang girl, you look good today."

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:44.379
Loving yourself is a process,

00:00:44.379 --> 00:00:45.786
and everybody is on their own clock.

00:00:45.786 --> 00:00:47.068
- Be free.

00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:47.901
Be wild.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:50.364
Stay creative.

00:00:50.364 --> 00:00:51.197
- Write a song.

00:00:51.197 --> 00:00:52.175
You need to talk about yourself.

00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:53.972
You need to like let it out.

00:00:53.972 --> 00:00:56.150
- You are responsible
for your own happiness,

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.912
and you need to go and find it.

00:00:57.912 --> 00:00:59.935
- Even your most depressing days

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.539
are a part of your evolution.

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:03.323
- Life is just about
believing in yourself,

00:01:03.323 --> 00:01:06.102
believing in your dreams,
and you are the dream.

00:01:06.102 --> 00:01:08.461
So as long as you're
believing in yourself, you are

00:01:08.461 --> 00:01:10.648
completing everything that
is necessary for you here

00:01:10.648 --> 00:01:12.691
in this time, in this
lifetime, in this moment.

00:01:12.691 --> 00:01:15.779
- What you have to offer
is everything that we need.

00:01:15.779 --> 00:01:16.909
Believe that.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:19.083
- There is so much power in each other.

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:21.614
- It's important to know that
you have a community of girls

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:22.677
and women supporting you.

00:01:22.677 --> 00:01:24.163
I am one of those people.

00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:26.419
- We are here for you! (chuckles)

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.086
- Find happiness in little things,

00:01:28.086 --> 00:01:30.129
and they will get bigger
and bigger and bigger.

00:01:30.129 --> 00:01:33.220
- At the end of the day, if you
are striving for perfection,

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.962
you're never going to get what you want.

00:01:34.962 --> 00:01:36.470
What you need to strive for

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.628
is being your true, authentic self.

00:01:39.628 --> 00:01:42.178
And that is when you're
going to really find peace,

00:01:42.178 --> 00:01:44.369
you're gonna find success,
and you're gonna find love

00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:45.780
in the best way possible.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:49.261
- I think the most important
thing is to just be you

00:01:49.261 --> 00:01:51.180
'cause nobody else is.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.118
- My parents were
amazing, and they told me,

00:01:53.118 --> 00:01:55.114
as long as I could
dream it, I could be it.

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.445
And I truly believe that.

00:01:56.445 --> 00:01:59.186
And so that means to this
day, I'm pretty sure I could

00:01:59.186 --> 00:02:01.636
still win an Olympic gold
medal in figuring skating,

00:02:01.636 --> 00:02:03.128
even though I'm way too old,
(logo whooshes)

00:02:03.128 --> 00:02:04.780
So, but if I can dream
it, I can be it, right?

